Z||000014||olympic||04-05-2000||01:53 AM||||0-60 in 4.3 sec???  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> Thats amazing!!!  A 300 HP Northstar Fiero will only do high 4's.||||reg||1
